1.4. **"Detection Heuristics and Architecture"** means the proprietary structure, sequence, organization, threshold matrices, weighting parameters, state machines, signal propagation models (including Free Space Path Loss, Timing Advance, RSRP/RSRQ/SINR correlation, and Kalman filtering), cellular protocol validators, logcat/RIL parsing rules, and the 42-method IMSI-catcher / fake-cell-tower detection and trust-scoring engine embodied in the Software.

