1.6. **"Commercial Use"** means any use, reproduction, modification, deployment, or distribution of the Software or any Derivative Work that is intended for, directed toward, or results in commercial advantage, monetary compensation, cost avoidance, business operations, or organizational benefit, whether direct or indirect.

1.7. **"Internal Business or Organizational Use"** means installing, deploying, running, evaluating in production, or distributing the Software or any Derivative Work within, by, at the direction of, or on behalf of any company, corporation, enterprise, news or media organization, law firm, consultancy, employer, government body, law enforcement agency, military/defense organization, educational institution's administrative IT fleet, or non-profit / non-governmental organization (NGO). This includes, without limitation:
