4.6. **No AI / Machine Learning Model Training:** Use the Software, its source code, documentation, or Detection Heuristics and Architecture to train, fine-tune, update weights of, or distill any third-party artificial intelligence model or large language model (LLM), nor sell datasets derived from the Software. *(Note: This restriction binds Licensees only and does not restrict Licensor's own AI training or data processing operations, nor does it prohibit ephemeral inference by automated coding agents permitted under Section 3.3).*

